# Squid HTTP basic auth password file (htpasswd format)
#
# Generate entries with:
#   htpasswd -c squid-auth/passwd <username>      # first user (overwrites)
#   htpasswd squid-auth/passwd <another-user>     # subsequent users
#
# Example (DO NOT use this password in production — for demo/CI only):
#   admin:$apr1$exampleSALT$exampleHASHvalueHere/
#
# The file is loaded by squid at startup; restart squid after edits.
